<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Professional CV (Generated sample)</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Full Name</h1>
    <p>Contact: you@example.com | +123 456 7890 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/you</p>

    <h2>Professional Profile</h2>
    <p>A short paragraph summarizing your experience, strengths, and what you bring to a role.</p>

    <h2>Work Experience</h2>
    <h3>Company Name — Job Title</h3>
    <p>Location | Month Year – Month Year</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Key responsibility or achievement (quantify when possible).</li>
      <li>Another relevant accomplishment.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <p>University Name — Degree, Major (Year)</p>

    <h2>Certifications</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Certification name — Issuer, Year</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Languages: JS, TS, Python</li>
      <li>Tools: Git, Docker, AWS</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Achievements & Honors</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Short bullet list of awards, publications, or major recognitions.</li>
    </ul>

    <hr />
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#666">This is a generated sample DOCX file saved as HTML for compatibility; open in Microsoft Word and save as a proper .docx if desired.</p>
  </body>
</html>
